      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi phamwenga na akulu a jeshi atanya ana anjina a Asafu, a Hemani na a Jeduthuni akale achitabiri kuno anapiga ngephephe, vinubi na matoazi. Higa ndigo madzina ga atu ambao ahenda kazi hiyo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula kpwa ana a Asafu kala ni Zakuri, Yusufu, Nethania na Asarela. Hinya akala tsini ya ulongozi wa Asafu, naye watabiri tsini ya ulongozi wa mfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeduthuni wakala na ana sita ambao ni Gedalia, Seri, Jeshaya, Shimei, Hashabia na Matithia. Nao akala tsini ya ulongozi wa ise yao Jeduthuni, ambaye watabiri kpwa kuhumira ngephephe, wakati osi anamshukuru na kumtogola Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a Hemani kala ni Bukia, Matania, Uzieli, Shebueli, Jerimothi; Hanania, Hanani, Eliatha, Gidaliti, Romamuti-Ezeri; Joshibekasha, Malothi, Hothiri na Mahaziothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano osi kala ni ana a Hemani muonadzi wa mfalume. Mlungu wamupha Hemani ana kumi na a ne a chilume na ahahu a chichetu. Ana hano wahewa sawa-sawa na ahadi ya Mlungu ili Hemani aphahe ishima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinya osi alongozwa ni ise yao, aimbe nyumbani mwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, kuno anahumira matoazi, vinubi na ngephephe kahi za utumishi wa Nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu. Asafu, Jeduthuni na Hemani kala a tsini ya ulongozi wa mfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osi phamwenga na ndugu zao afundzwa kumuimbira Mwenyezi Mlungu, na achikala na ujuzi, nao isabu yao kala ni atu magana mairi mirongo minane na nane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao apiga kura, mvyere kpwa mdide, mwalimu kpwa mwanafundzi, osi sawa, ili aphahe mazuma ga kuhenda kazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
